<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kedah year net up 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kedah year net up 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 117.28   vs	  78.81</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 28.29   vs	  22.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		   561.61   vs	 338.53</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   122.74   vs	  79.78</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	15.00   vs	  15.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia Kedah Cement Holdings Bhd is involved in making and selling bagged and bulk cement</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
